CHECK:COMPARISON_TO_NULL: Comparison to NULL could be written "!status"
#145: FILE: drivers/of/base.c:582:
+	if (status == NULL)

Comparisons to NULL in the form (foo == NULL) or (foo != NULL)
are better written as (!foo) and (foo).

